{
  "spec": "chp/2",
  "plugin": {
    "id": "hamdraw_chp",
    "label": {
      "zh": "CHP 插件（CHPCP）",
      "en": "CHP plugin (CHPCP)"
    },
    "version": "3.2.0"
  },
  "auth": {
    "required": true,
    "authorized": true,
    "scheme": "Bearer",
    "header": "Authorization",
    "hint": "密码在 ComfyUI 的 CHP 插件配置节点里设置。"
  },
  "endpoints": {
    "info": "/chp/info",
    "jobs": "/chp/jobs",
    "job": "/chp/jobs/{job_id}",
    "progress": "/chp/jobs/{job_id}/progress",
    "output": "/chp/jobs/{job_id}/output/{index}",
    "cancel": "/chp/jobs/{job_id}/cancel",
    "translate": "/chp/translate",
    "speech": "/chp/speech"
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "category": "fast",
      "rule": "txt-ref-2-img",
      "signature": "txt-ref-2-img",
      "input": "txt-ref-2-img/v1",
      "label": {
        "zh": "快速生图",
        "en": "Quick draw"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "把画布当作参考图重绘一张 512 × 512 的速写稿。",
        "en": "Redraw the canvas as a 512 × 512 sketch."
      },
      "needs": {
        "prompt": true,
        "image": true,
        "mask": false
      },
      "prompt": {
        "language": "en"
      },
      "defaults": {
        "ref_strength": 0.55
      },
      "typical_seconds": 1.2
    }
  ],
  "abilities": [
    {
      "name": "DreamShaper8_LCM.safetensors",
      "files": {
        "checkpoint": "DreamShaper8_LCM.safetensors"
      },
      "ready": true,
      "missing": [],
      "frames": [
        {
          "ratio": "1:1",
          "resolution": [
            "512x512"
          ],
          "category": "fast"
        },
        {
          "ratio": "4:3",
          "resolution": [
            "576x384"
          ],
          "category": "fast"
        },
        {
          "ratio": "3:4",
          "resolution": [
            "384x576"
          ],
          "category": "fast"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "input_schemas": {
    "txt-ref-2-img/v1": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "category",
        "resolution",
        "seed"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "category": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": {
            "zh": "场景",
            "en": "Category"
          },
          "help": {
            "zh": "要哪个功能场景。取值见信息文档的 rules。",
            "en": "Which functional scenario. The information document's rules list them."
          }
        },
        "resolution": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^\\d+x\\d+$",
          "title": {
            "zh": "分辨率",
            "en": "Resolution"
          },
          "help": {
            "zh": "输出画幅, 写成 \"宽x高\"(如 \"768x1344\")。必填, 且只能取该类别帧表里列出的值 —— 低/中/高三档, 顺序就是帧表里的顺序。",
            "en": "Output canvas as \"WxH\" (e.g. \"768x1344\"). Required, and only a value from that category's frames — low/mid/high, in the order the frames list them."
          }
        },
        "prompt": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "title": {
            "zh": "提示词",
            "en": "Prompt"
          },
          "help": {
            "zh": "画面描述。是否需要先译成英文由 rules[].prompt.language 决定。",
            "en": "What to draw. Whether it must be English first is the rule's prompt.language."
          }
        },
        "seed": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "default": 0,
          "title": {
            "zh": "随机种子",
            "en": "Seed"
          },
          "help": {
            "zh": "0 表示每张都不一样; 同一个值可以复现。",
            "en": "0 means a new seed each run; the same value reproduces."
          }
        },
        "ref_strength": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0.05,
          "maximum": 0.95,
          "title": {
            "zh": "参考图权重",
            "en": "Reference influence"
          },
          "help": {
            "zh": "0.05–0.95, 越大越贴近参考图, 越低越放手重画。越界会被夹到边界。",
            "en": "0.05–0.95. Higher stays closer to the reference, lower redraws more freely. Out of range is clamped."
          }
        },
        "image_base64": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "base64-image",
          "title": {
            "zh": "参考图",
            "en": "Reference"
          },
          "help": {
            "zh": "参考图, PNG/JPEG 的 base64, 可直接给 data URL。只有规则里带 ref 的场景收它(见 rules[].signature); 纯文生图那条收了会被拒。",
            "en": "Reference image as base64 PNG/JPEG; a data URL is accepted as-is. Only rules whose signature contains ref take it; the text-to-image rule refuses it."
          }
        },
        "mask_base64": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "base64-image",
          "title": {
            "zh": "蒙版",
            "en": "Mask"
          },
          "help": {
            "zh": "蒙版, 黑底白区, 白色 = 要重画。",
            "en": "Mask, black background with a white area; white means repaint."
          }
        },
        "ext_params": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "default": {},
          "title": {
            "zh": "模型扩展参数",
            "en": "Model extensions"
          },
          "help": {
            "zh": "模型层的扩展参数, 原样携带、原样回显。规范不定义任何字段。",
            "en": "Model-layer extension parameters, carried and echoed verbatim. The spec defines no field in it."
          }
        },
        "chp_params": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "default": {},
          "title": {
            "zh": "CHP 扩展参数",
            "en": "CHP extensions"
          },
          "help": {
            "zh": "CHP 层的扩展参数。目前只有 password。",
            "en": "CHP-layer extension parameters. Today only password."
          }
        },
        "request_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 200,
          "title": {
            "zh": "提交编号",
            "en": "Request id"
          },
          "help": {
            "zh": "可选。这次提交自己的编号, 由客户端生成。重发同一次提交时沿用同一个值, 服务端就还你**原来那个作业**, 不会再排一个; 换了内容就要换一个值。",
            "en": "Optional. The client's own id for this submission. Send the same value when retrying the same submission and the server answers with the original job instead of queueing a second one; use a new value when the content changes."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "translation": {
    "available": true,
    "mode": "auto-on-submit",
    "target": "en",
    "backend": {
      "style": "openai-chat-completions",
      "model": "qwen3-0.6b"
    },
    "memory": {
      "schema": "chp-translation-memory/v1",
      "entries": 0,
      "limit": 4000
    },
    "rule": "提示词只含 ASCII 时原样提交, 不发起翻译"
  },
  "errors": [
    "bad_image",
    "bad_mask",
    "bad_request",
    "busy",
    "duplicate_request",
    "forbidden_capability",
    "internal",
    "invalid_workflow",
    "no_engine",
    "no_model",
    "no_upstream",
    "not_found",
    "speech_failed",
    "stretched_reference",
    "unauthorized",
    "unsupported_category",
    "unsupported_size",
    "unsupported_steps",
    "unsupported_voice"
  ],
  "speech": {
    "rules": [],
    "abilities": [],
    "input_schemas": {}
  }
}
